{"version":1,"content":"<p>大約三個月前，SK集團會長崔泰源對SK海力士股票給出了「持有」的建議。但該股當前價格依舊較高點回落近60%。不少在高位附近入場的散户深度套牢，陷入既不敢割肉、也無力加倉的境地。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583546.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T08:23:48.307056+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:10:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T08:18:03.413763+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T08:18:03.413763+00:00","content_hash":"e8d93e985217c22d3bbe5f052757565d711b5665de8c43bbfb13b9e32f319493","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}